{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a man who has lost not only the path, but also himself. Reality blurs as the past comes to life within the walls of this dead neighborhood. Explore the city, interact with its inhabitants \u2014 alive and not quite \u2014 and uncover the mystery hidden beneath the layers of greyness and despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric world inspired by late Soviet architecture and industrial aesthetics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An author's soundtrack that enhances the feeling of isolation and anxiety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-obvious choices affecting the development of history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A study where every object found can change your view of what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is waiting. Don't be late.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3032100?t=1753945356","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032100/943f2506136ec1c37dcdc7c8249e1733234e56bd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753945356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032100/118518cc9d41fd3da26d9ea98c6dc3529542d199/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753945356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032100/118518cc9d41fd3da26d9ea98c6dc3529542d199/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753945356","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a man who has lost not only the path, but also himself. Reality blurs as the past comes to life within the walls of this dead neighborhood. Explore the city, interact with its inhabitants \u2014 alive and not quite \u2014 and uncover the mystery hidden beneath the layers of greyness and despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric world inspired by late Soviet architecture and industrial aesthetics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An author's soundtrack that enhances the feeling of isolation and anxiety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-obvious choices affecting the development of history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A study where every object found can change your view of what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is waiting. Don't be late.</p>","developers":["Beer Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032100/6c817525b6108c63ff3c282fc3162fec1e0b8da4/header.jpg?t=1753945356","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3032100/1912181547/a2d0d82c0b0b5a32d20f680d8ba9278c5561496d/1750960156/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753945354","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3032100/1912181547/a2d0d82c0b0b5a32d20f680d8ba9278c5561496d/1750960156/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753945354","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3032100/1912181547/a2d0d82c0b0b5a32d20f680d8ba9278c5561496d/1750960156/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753945354","id":257029936,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257029936/movie480.mp4?t=1753945354","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257029936/movie_max.mp4?t=1753945354"},"name":"Kvartal Of Sky","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257029936/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1753945354","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257029936/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753945354","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257029936/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753945354"}}],"name":"Kvartal Of Sky","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul 